Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-18 (the footprint editor's
design, section 6.3; unit fp-i4), no third-party content: each footprint here
is our own, named as KiCad names its kinds of part.
- legacy.mod, one footprint in KiCad 5's legacy footprint format
  (PCBNEW-LibModule-V1, units mm): LEGACY_R0805, two SMD pads, silkscreen
  lines and an outline on the user drawing layer. KiCad's Legacy reader
  takes it as a set of one.
- package.lbr, one Eagle package in Eagle's library XML: EAGLE_R0603, two SMD
  pads on Top, tPlace lines, a tDocu body and the >NAME and >VALUE texts.
  KiCad's Eagle reader takes it as a set of one.
Both are read by footprint.convert in tests/e2e/footprint-edit.spec.ts.
The files carry no comment (their formats have none we may add), so this file
holds their license.
